# Layer 6 fixture Weave config for the real-CLI agent-materialization smoke.
#
# Loaded by `@weaveio/weave-config`'s `loadConfig()` when the real `opencode2`
# CLI runs the Weave adapter's `setup(ctx)`. An empty config is enough:
# `loadConfig` merges the built-in agents (Loom, Shuttle, ...) from
# `@weaveio/weave-config`'s `builtins.ts`, so the resulting materialization
# plan produces a `loom` descriptor that the plugin-wrapper then observes
# via `ctx.agent.list()` and writes to a marker file.
#
# See layer-5 fixture (`../agent-materialization/.weave/config.weave`) for the
# equivalent invariants exercised through the embedded SDK path.
